plugin-hostd-protocol (0.5.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release: plugin-hostd-protocol 0.5.5
  * protocol: node_metadata, the JACK metadata on a hosted node's client
    (plugin-hostd#33)
  * schema: the table declares the JACK metadata of a hosted node
    (plugin-hostd#33)
  * version-check: a staged build's +git<sha> stamp is not compared
  * release: plugin-hostd-protocol 0.5.4
  * release: a dispatched run with staged on publishes to the staging channel
  * protocol: PRESET_NOT_APPLIED, a preset the plugin took and had not
    applied when the wait ran out
  * include: plugin_db_vocabulary.h rendered again from plugin-db 0.3.1
  * release: build the DEBs beside the RPMs
  * ci: cancel a pull request's stale runs

